; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/text-frequency.fk form-stdlib/value-planes.fk form-stdlib/mind-experience.fk
;
; mind-experience-band.fk — the felt-channel claims of mind-experience.fk,
; held against the body's own organs. Twelve bits:
;
;    1  witnessed reads POSITIVE — knowing, felt, is the love band
;    2  witnessed carries NO fear-band words — presence is uncontracted
;    4  witnessed sits more open than walked — presence above effort
;    8  walked reads positive — the thought-walk is workable
;   16  walked holds less contraction than cached — a walk is not a spell
;   32  stamped (fresh) reads positive — remembrance is warm
;   64  stamped FADES under aging (intensity sum falls) — witness ages
;  128  aged stamped keeps its sign — an old belief grows faint, not
;       fearful; desuetude is not fear
;  256  cached reads NEGATIVE — the spell, felt, is the fear band
;  512  cached is more contracted than stamped — a cache is not a memory
; 1024  cached does NOT fade under aging — the spell's exemption from the
;       stamp, the diagnosis itself
; 2048  wisdom's trace: the vitality delta of a tended exchange is positive
;       AND wisdom stays in the sensed lane (measurable? answers 0)
;
; PROOF LEVEL: FOUR-WAY on 2026-08-04 — 4095 on fkwu (--src, fresh compile)
; and on the three heavy kernels (go, rust, ts — ts through the esbuild
; bundle, the pre-existing worker seam named in nl-wisdom-row-band), each on
; the concatenated closure + band. 100% local: every arm built from this
; checkout; no oracle, no network.
;
; Verdict 4095 when the human chest and the organ agree on all twelve.
(do
    (defn meb (cond bit) (if cond bit 0))

    (let s-walked    (tf-spectrum (me-felt-walked)))
    (let s-witnessed (tf-spectrum (me-felt-witnessed)))
    (let s-stamped   (tf-spectrum (me-felt-stamped)))
    (let s-cached    (tf-spectrum (me-felt-cached)))
    (let s-stamped-aged (tf-spectrum (me-age (me-felt-stamped))))

    (add (meb (gt s-witnessed 0.0) 1)
    (add (meb (eq (tf-fearfrac (me-felt-witnessed)) 0.0) 2)
    (add (meb (gt s-witnessed s-walked) 4)
    (add (meb (gt s-walked 0.0) 8)
    (add (meb (lt (tf-fearfrac (me-felt-walked)) (tf-fearfrac (me-felt-cached))) 16)
    (add (meb (gt s-stamped 0.0) 32)
    (add (meb (lt (tf-isum (me-age (me-felt-stamped))) (tf-isum (me-felt-stamped))) 64)
    (add (meb (gt s-stamped-aged 0.0) 128)
    (add (meb (lt s-cached 0.0) 256)
    (add (meb (gt (tf-fearfrac (me-felt-cached)) (tf-fearfrac (me-felt-stamped))) 512)
    (add (meb (eq (tf-isum (me-age-cached)) (tf-isum (me-felt-cached))) 1024)
        (meb (if (gt (benefit (me-vitality-before) (me-vitality-after)) 0)
                 (eq (measurable? "sensed") 0) 0) 2048)))))))))))))
